  "403c41aa-8654-4ec7-aaf8-865dd563e351"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives a list of one walk drawn from ",
 StyleBox["walks", "TI"],
 ", read as points of a metric space.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"864b20aa-d929-4e5c-a044-5eb8fb93cbd9"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["SelectInfraWalk"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/SelectInfraWalk", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
